        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.084,
            0.744,
            0.183
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We have learnt that the plants and animals living in a particular region have special features that make them fit to survive there. The special features that enable plants and animals to survive in a particular region are called "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "adaptations",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.183,
            0.743,
            0.242
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The shape of the deodar tree and the height of the rhododendron are adaptations that enable them to survive in the mountainous regions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.242,
            0.744,
            0.422
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The place where plants and animals live is called their "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "habitat",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ". For example, the habitat of sea turtles is the sea or the ocean. The habitat of a camel is the hot or the cold desert, and the habitat of a rhododendron is the mountains. The habitat of plants and animals provides them food, water, air, shelter and other needs for their survival. Many types of plants and animals may share the same habitat. Habitat plays an important role in shaping the biodiversity of a region."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.449,
            0.29,
            0.469
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Know a scientist"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.497,
            0.65,
            0.743
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Salim Ali",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (1896–1987) travelled across India to observe diversity in birds. He prepared a list of birds and documented their travel routes and habitats. He recorded the regions with high diversity of birds and took measures to conserve these regions. Keoladeo National Park in Bharatpur, Rajasthan and Ranganathittu Bird Sanctuary in Mandya, Karnataka are examples of regions he preserved. He wrote a landmark series of 10 books on birds of the Indian Subcontinent. He is referred to as the ‘Birdman of India’. He was awarded Padma Vibhushan in 1976."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.668,
            0.553,
            0.811,
            0.689
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.668,
                0.553,
                0.811,
                0.689
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_18_image_5.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.758,
            0.744,
            0.836
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What are the different ways in which you can group plants and animals based on their habitats? One way is to group them into those ‘that live on land’ and those ‘that live in water’."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.836,
            0.744,
            0.898
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The plants and animals that live on land are said to live in "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "terrestrial",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " habitats. Some examples of terrestrial habitats are forests, deserts, grasslands, and mountains."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "aside_text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.889,
            0.716,
            0.91,
            0.859
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Diversity in the Living World"
            }
          ]
        },
